      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.CWLIntent",
      "name": "CWLIntent",
      "itemClass": "schema",
      "abstract": "An identifier for the type of computational operation a process\nperforms, especially useful for `Operation` but also usable on `CommandLineTool`, `Workflow`, or\n`ExpressionTool`. If provided, must be an IRI of a concept node representing the operation type,\npreferably defined within an ontology \u2014 for example an EDAM Ontology operation concept such as\n`http://edamontology.org/operation_2928` (Alignment).",
