      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.requirements.ShellCommandRequirement",
      "name": "ShellCommandRequirement",
      "itemClass": "schema",
      "abstract": "Modifies CommandLineTool execution to generate a single\nshell command-line string: each item in `arguments` is joined with spaces and shell-quoted, unless\nits `CommandLineBinding` sets `shellQuote: false` \u2014 in which case it is joined unquoted, allowing\nshell metacharacters such as `|` for pipes.",
