    {
      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.workflow-step.CWLWorkflowStepObject",
      "name": "CWLWorkflowStepObject",
      "itemClass": "schema",
      "abstract": "The executable shape of a single Workflow step: how its\nunderlying process is invoked (`run`), how workflow parameters are wired to and from it (`in`,\n`out`), an optional guard condition (`when`), and scatter/gather behavior (`scatter`,\n`scatterMethod`) for fanning the step out over array inputs. Used directly as the value type when\n`steps` is given as a map keyed by step id; see `CWLWorkflowStepItem` for the list form, where the\nid is an explicit field instead.",
