    {
      "itemIdentifier": "ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.CWL",
      "name": "CWL",
      "itemClass": "schema",
      "abstract": "The root of the register: a Common Workflow Language v1.2.1 Application Package document.\n\nA CWL document is one of three top-level forms: a single CommandLineTool/ExpressionTool/Workflow\ndefinition (`CWLAtomic`), the same wrapped as a nested `run` definition inside a Workflow step\n(`CWLAtomicNested`), or a `$graph`-wrapped document (`CWLGraph`).",
